{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold River Project\u2122 throws you and your friends on an epic camping survival adventure! Try to escape a grueling experiment across one of the largest private nature reserves in the Pacific Northwest. You are being watched, studied and manipulated at every turn. Solve the mysteries within and try to survive another day.\u00a0Players logging 100+ hours are still finding new points of interest, lore, and content, and the game is still growing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Substations, supplies and points of interest\u00a0 - these locations change with each new play through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building:</strong>\u00a0Craft and expand your campsite to prepare for what's to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>, <strong>Stealth</strong> or <strong>Discovery:</strong>\u00a0There is more than one way out of this experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting:</strong>\u00a0Craft and Build campsite essentials, weapons, farm plots and more to help you stay alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Survive by yourself or with friends in online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn:</strong> Discover new things to craft from items you find or from trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong> All items are all useful, it's up t\ufeffo you to figure it out how.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong>: Play at your own pace. No time restrictions. Prepare accordingly for upcoming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine</strong>: Built in Unreal Engine 5.4.4 upgrading to 5.7.4 summer 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>CAMP SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gold River! A remote camping adventure you can play alone or with up to 4 friends. A chartered float plane will drop you off by beautiful lakes where you can kayak, hike the gorgeous trails, make camp and survive the elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.poster.avif?t=1776890002\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.webm?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.mp4?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TRUE CAMPING SURVIVAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped and now an unwilling lab rat. Can you survive an ever changing, artificial environment and it's inhabitants?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.poster.avif?t=1776890002\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.webm?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.mp4?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE THE ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage health, hydration, hunger, fatigue, and temperature. Use your survival skills and earn badges as you learn new ones. Outlast nature and uncover the perils of what lies beneath the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.poster.avif?t=1776890002\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.webm?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.mp4?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVING SEASONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world shifts with time. Hunt in the abundance of summer, forage in the dying colors of fall, and fight for warmth in the frozen quiet of winter. Find your way through increasingly harsh environments and outsmart your captors to survive and escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a mysterious barrier dividing the forest. Solve environmental puzzles, sneak past security patrols, or piece together scavenged tech to bring it down your own way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"78967dc72af98626cf48deee18a945c2f276222b.jpg","localized_name":"Swim Badge - Level 1","name":"Swim Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/78967dc72af98626cf48deee18a945c2f276222b.jpg"},{"icon":"bfe6fe4ddc70aa3094bc5466ade8d943fe362078.jpg","localized_name":"First Aid Badge - Level 1","name":"First Aid Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/bfe6fe4ddc70aa3094bc5466ade8d943fe362078.jpg"},{"icon":"6c63e746617a1bda9645b368f6bd4f5691400ce5.jpg","localized_name":"Archery Badge - Level 1","name":"Archery Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/6c63e746617a1bda9645b368f6bd4f5691400ce5.jpg"},{"icon":"b690d954e228fbab4c61a1c9b189e1b1e35c8d78.jpg","localized_name":"Bow Hunting Badge - Level 1","name":"Bow Hunting Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/b690d954e228fbab4c61a1c9b189e1b1e35c8d78.jpg"},{"icon":"7eda6a25ea90fd07e9a90a99f39ae5ddcb0f150c.jpg","localized_name":"Campfire Badge - Level 1","name":"Campfire Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/7eda6a25ea90fd07e9a90a99f39ae5ddcb0f150c.jpg"},{"icon":"116ea0f48e0b02d4ef2ab82d837b85d009446a1f.jpg","localized_name":"Canoe Badge - Level 1","name":"Canoe Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/116ea0f48e0b02d4ef2ab82d837b85d009446a1f.jpg"},{"icon":"9d5e015a807edf703cf033d5bf67004f1e2d3bce.jpg","localized_name":"Cooking Badge - Level 1","name":"Cooking Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/9d5e015a807edf703cf033d5bf67004f1e2d3bce.jpg"},{"icon":"db9c6240c8a1905a3105056104fb603dc4d25e02.jpg","localized_name":"Crafting Badge - Level 1","name":"Crafting Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/db9c6240c8a1905a3105056104fb603dc4d25e02.jpg"},{"icon":"99d9e169d2d4e629f8c4ea0fdcd89c4ace735a85.jpg","localized_name":"Exploring Badge - Level 1","name":"Exploring Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/99d9e169d2d4e629f8c4ea0fdcd89c4ace735a85.jpg"},{"icon":"7e89e4122f94ed1fdb8de61ade1024c926c10ee4.jpg","localized_name":"Farming Badge - Level 1","name":"Farming Badge - Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1253220/7e89e4122f94ed1fdb8de61ade1024c926c10ee4.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1253220?t=1776890002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776890002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/f7006a8eb2ff882d7983512a9f07bb937a50f289/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776890002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/f7006a8eb2ff882d7983512a9f07bb937a50f289/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776890002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is simulated shooting and killing of other players and animals. Minimal blood and gore."},"demos":[{"appid":3758470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>WHAT PLAYERS ARE SAYING</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cJust loving it\u2026 main game, I\u2019m hooked.\u201d<br>- <strong>102.1 hours played</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIt has been a blast so far!\u201d<br>- <strong>119.1 hours played</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHas more potential than I\u2019ve ever seen an Early Access game have.\u201d<br>- <strong>52.1 hours played</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI am 11 game days in\u2026 the map is huge.\u201d<br>- <strong>36.1 hours played</strong></p></p><br><h1>PC PERFORMANCE NOTES</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold River Project is a large open-world survival game built in Unreal Engine 5.<br>For the best experience, we recommend a modern gaming PC with a high-end GPU and at least 16 GB RAM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick guidelines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 GB or more of VRAM recommended</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SSD required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the demo runs well on your system, the full game should perform similarly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required for multiplayer (player-hosted servers)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full system requirements are listed below on this page.</p></p><br><h1>2026 ROAD MAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/d3adb33fea33027d78deaa34c48d097d.avif?t=1776890002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras_big/d3adb33fea33027d78deaa34c48d097d.avif?t=1776890002 width=1560 height=1496 /></span></p></p><br><h1>DEMO INFO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/dd4101c977d243b0502fea568e796272.avif?t=1776890002\" width=745 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo offers a <strong>limited</strong> amount of playtime set in the Summer season, where each playthrough is unique. It\u2019s a safe and welcoming environment to get familiar with the world and its systems. We are offering single player and multiplayer (up to 4 players) with the demo. If you enjoy the demo, the Early Access version is now available for purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access  introduces new seasons, expanded content, additional threats, unique challenges, and most importantly, unlimited playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your system can run the Demo, you can run the Early Access version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/6a28e3a7b9a11e3fe3106c92891dfcbb.avif?t=1776890002\" width=744 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need more information? Want to chat with fellow campers? Come on over and join our Discord channel!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold River Project\u2122 throws you and your friends on an epic camping survival adventure! Try to escape a grueling experiment across one of the largest private nature reserves in the Pacific Northwest. You are being watched, studied and manipulated at every turn. Solve the mysteries within and try to survive another day.\u00a0Players logging 100+ hours are still finding new points of interest, lore, and content, and the game is still growing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Substations, supplies and points of interest\u00a0 - these locations change with each new play through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building:</strong>\u00a0Craft and expand your campsite to prepare for what's to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>, <strong>Stealth</strong> or <strong>Discovery:</strong>\u00a0There is more than one way out of this experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting:</strong>\u00a0Craft and Build campsite essentials, weapons, farm plots and more to help you stay alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Survive by yourself or with friends in online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn:</strong> Discover new things to craft from items you find or from trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge:</strong> All items are all useful, it's up t\ufeffo you to figure it out how.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong>: Play at your own pace. No time restrictions. Prepare accordingly for upcoming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine</strong>: Built in Unreal Engine 5.4.4 upgrading to 5.7.4 summer 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>CAMP SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Gold River! A remote camping adventure you can play alone or with up to 4 friends. A chartered float plane will drop you off by beautiful lakes where you can kayak, hike the gorgeous trails, make camp and survive the elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.poster.avif?t=1776890002\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.webm?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.mp4?t=1776890002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TRUE CAMPING SURVIVAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped and now an unwilling lab rat. Can you survive an ever changing, artificial environment and it's inhabitants?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.poster.avif?t=1776890002\" width=800 height=400 ><source 